{"schemaVersion":1,"entryType":"final_answer","turnId":"1","occurredAt":"2026-09-16T16:52:41.868Z","message":"Verification complete. Evidence for each task:\n\n| # | Task | Evidence |\n|---|---|---|\n| 2 | 双面包声明 | `dsh --profile cindy-smoke --dump-config` composes; boot graph contains `{\"id\":\"dsh-cindy-host-demo\",\"url\":\"/plugins/??dsh-cindy-host-demo/client.js&rev=…\"}`; bundle served HTTP 200 / 25375 B (before this it would have thrown `declares dsh.client but exports no \"./client\" bundle`) |\n| 3 | 非交互式登录 | `src/cindy-login-flow.js` + `restoreSession`; 17 tests cover identifier validation, ok/nested/flat token answers, `select_account`/`binding_required`/`sso_verification_required`, refresh expiry; live `POST …/login/request-code` with an empty identifier → 400 without touching Cindy |\n| 4 | relay 状态机 | `src/host.js` + `src/host-status.js`; 20 tests (hello `remoteControlEnabled=true`, hello-ack→waiting, presence, link-open→connected, invoke, ping/pong, revoked device, switch-off teardown); live: authenticated → real `deviceId`/`userId` → `connected` |\n| 5 | HTTP 路由 | `src/host-routes.js`; 11 tests (loopback-only 403, status, 404, 503, body limits, handler-failure 500); live: status 200, unknown 404 |\n| 6 | 设置卡片 | `lib/client.js`; 11 tests render the card with React (`settings.plugin.item`/key `dsh-cindy-host`, switch, five labels, login form, device rows); live: bundle served with `__ModuleLoader__.load` |\n| 7 | 测试与文档 | 82/82 `node --test`; README + `doc/cindy-phone-link.md` record the four protocol answers with source anchors |\n\nLive switch-off proof: status → `{\"state\":\"disconnected\",\"host\":null,\"devices\":[]}` and the dsh process held **0** established sockets."}
